+**Sidebar filter menu:** the funnel and Select sessions sit in a toolbar row
+above the scrolling session list, labelled with the current Display choice, so
+they stay in view however far the list scrolls; while selecting, the bulk-action
+bar takes the row under them. With `sidebar_grouping_ui` on, the funnel holds
+Grouping, Display, Ordering and Show; in Status, Harness, Created or Updated
+grouping, Projects is hidden. Select sessions selects project, Shared and
+Sessions rows together; the Sessions header keeps only New session. Hovering a
